We’re gonna be talking about Spooky Month, a beloved Newgrounds series and, quite frankly, one of the best the platform has to offer
So, without further adoo, let me start by explaining what’s a Spooky Month 

Spooky Month, or the Spooky Month series, is a episodic collection created by SrPelo(pronounced Senior Pelo)
The first episode released in October 30, 2018 (I’m not giving specific dates for the episodes, but this is the exception)
The series follows the adventures of Skid and Pump, two childhood friends who absolutely LOVE Halloween
That first one is basically an funny introduction to some of the characters to be introduced later down the line
(not including the detective guys and The Eyes of the World, but including the Ooga Booga)
The series, right now, has a total of 6 official episodes, with 1 short as well
The last episode was posted back in 2024, but there are plenty more to come later down the line
(I’m expecting one in a few weeks, since Halloween is right around the corner, the main reason why I’m doing this)

Now, I won’t go too deep in the lore here, but let’s just say, the more episodes you watch, the more you realize this is more than just funny
This series has a deep rich history and all of its characters are meticulously crafted to play their specific role
Take Moloch, for example, the family’s pet demon
On the outside, he looks like a scary monster, but really he just wants to fit in 
(and also take control of the kids so he can take over the world but let’s ignore that for now)
I heavily encourage you to go watch the episodes if you haven’t already, trust me, you will not regret it

It’s not just me with this opinion, several people on Newgrounds think that Spooky Month is one of the most-highly rated series
Look no further than the score ranking, within the top 50 best-score submissions to Newgrounds, Spooky Month takes 4 of those spots
It’s also one of the most-viewed series on Newgrounds, being rivaled only by Madness Combat (no doi)
And, of course who could forget, they cameo in so many other series 
